s to $\\mathbb{R}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{Z}^{-}$ contains the negative integers. Therefore, $-\\pi$ does not belong to $\\mathbb{Z}^{-}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{R}^{-}$ contains the negative real numbers. Therefore, $-\\pi$ belongs to $\\mathbb{R}^{-}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{C}$ contains all complex numbers. Therefore, $-\\pi$ belongs to $\\mathbb{C}$.\n\nTherefore, select $\\mathbb{R}$, $\\mathbb{R}^{-}$, $\\mathbb{C}$ only."] [:db/add "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2" :question/answer-fields "82f47dc6-ad18-58cb-ae9d-9e41fb01c64f"] [:db/add "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2" :question/answer-fields "76d5abf9-cdcd-51b2-b6cb-1538e8e8e94d"] [:db/add "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2" :question/answer-fields "1fb2ce9a-9f23-58a7-8bb6-c1bf1db54010"] [:db/add "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2" :question/answer-fields "ed77a8a8-c123-5025-b1c6-13fa8b64b2a3"] [:db/add "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2" :question/answer-fields "0ff9df39-3e7c-5f20-b49d-977a253111a6"] [:db/ensure "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054816 :knowledge-point/questions "821ce378-9699-5ee1-9fb0-4ad0ce16f9e2"] [:db/add "0bdc920f-2384-521b-9f42-04dfdc7cb28e" :answer/id #uuid "0bdc920f-2384-521b-9f42-04dfdc7cb28e"] [:db/add "0bdc920f-2384-521b-9f42-04dfdc7cb28e" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "0bdc920f-2384-521b-9f42-04dfdc7cb28e" :answer/value "I and IV only"] [:db/ensure "0bdc920f-2384-521b-9f42-04dfdc7cb28e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0a41eb87-6bc1-54f1-a4a9-359f1f24bd86" :answer/id #uuid "0a41eb87-6bc1-54f1-a4a9-359f1f24bd86"] [:db/add "0a41eb87-6bc1-54f1-a4a9-359f1f24bd86" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "0a41eb87-6bc1-54f1-a4a9-359f1f24bd86" :answer/value "I and II only"] [:db/ensure "0a41eb87-6bc1-54f1-a4a9-359f1f24bd86" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2b54c966-674b-51a2-b20f-75e73c4356fe" :answer/id #uuid "2b54c966-674b-5